%% 08 · S2 构建流水线时序
%% 主线：make stage2 → CLI → plan → Meta → ES → Qdrant → manifest → exit
%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"noteBkgColor": "#f9fafb", "noteBorderColor": "#6b7280", "noteTextColor": "#374151"}, "sequence": {"actorMargin": 45, "width": 130, "messageMargin": 32, "boxMargin": 8, "noteMargin": 8, "mirrorActors": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MK as Make
    participant CLI as CLI
    participant PL as Plan
    participant EM as Embedder
    participant MT as Meta
    participant ES as ES
    participant QD as Qdrant

    MK->>CLI: make stage2（dry-run → fresh → verify 三次调用）
    CLI->>CLI: argparse 解析互斥开关
    Note over CLI: --dry-run / --fresh / --verify / --assert-idempotent

    alt --dry-run
        CLI->>PL: load_plan(config)
        PL-->>CLI: BuildPlan + counts()
        CLI-->>MK: 打印计数，0 writes，exit 0
    else --verify
        CLI->>MT: read_manifest() + 只读计数
        CLI->>ES: 计数 + 样例文档
        CLI->>QD: 计数 + 向量维度
        CLI-->>MK: VERIFY PASS / FAIL，exit 0 / 1
    else 构建（默认 / --fresh / --assert-idempotent）
        CLI->>PL: load_plan(config)
        PL-->>CLI: BuildPlan（纯内存，不连存储）
        alt --fresh
            CLI->>MT: drop_database + create_schema
        else 增量
            CLI->>MT: read_manifest() 比对 config_hash
            Note over CLI,MT: 哈希 / 计数 / 样例全一致 → noop，0 writes
        end
        CLI->>ES: delete + create
        CLI->>QD: delete + create（列 / 指标两个 collection）
        CLI->>MT: write_plan() 44 行
        CLI->>ES: bulk_index() 76 条取值文档
        CLI->>EM: embed_many(98 条列文本)
        CLI->>QD: upsert() 98 个列点
        CLI->>EM: embed_many(22 条指标文本)
        CLI->>QD: upsert() 22 个指标点
        CLI->>MT: write_manifest(build_id, status, counts)
        CLI-->>MK: BUILT writes=241，exit 0
    end
